Package: qore-git-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-git-module-doc
Description: Git repository operations and data providers for Qore
 This package provides libgit2 bindings, virtual and disk repositories,
 GitDataProvider, GitConfigManager, GitForgeHelper and GitConnections.
 It includes source and compiled modules, compiler metadata, provider resources
 and translations for repository, connection and configuration workflows.

Package: qore-git-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-git-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's Git modules
 This package contains HTML API references and example tests for the git
 native module and its four user modules.
